bsite"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Privacy Policy"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Privacy Policy for Ecom Circles LLC:data collection, usage, security, and your rights."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://ecomcircles.com/og-image.png"/><?php include __DIR__ . '/include/head-icons.php'; ?></head><body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><?php include __DIR__ . '/include/header.php'; ?>
    <main class="flex-1"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Privacy Policy","description":"Privacy Policy for Ecom Circles LLC.data collection, usage, security, and your rights.","url":"https://ecomcircles.com/privacy/","breadcrumb":{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://ecomcircles.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Privacy Policy","item":"https://ecomcircles.com/privacy/"}]}}</script><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white bg-shades"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20"><nav class="mb-8 text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-normal" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><a class="hover:text-neutral-500" href="index.php">Home</a><span class="mx-1.5">›</span><span class="text-neutral-600">Privacy Policy</span></nav><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 md:text-4xl" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-500" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Last Updated: March 22, 2026</p></div></section><section class="bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-12 md:py-16" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="prose prose-neutral max-w-none prose-headings:font-semibold prose-h2:text-xl prose-h2:mt-10 prose-h2:mb-4 prose-h3:text-lg prose-h3:mt-6 prose-h3:mb-3 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-li:leading-relaxed"><p>Ecom Circles LLC (“Company,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, how we share it, and your rights regarding your personal data.</p><h2>Information We Collect</h2><h3>Information You Provide Directly</h3><p><strong>Account Registration:</strong> Name, email address, password, company name, phone number, and business address.</p><p><strong>Marketplace Connections:</strong> Amazon Seller Central credentials (OAuth tokens, not passwords), Walmart seller credentials, eBay seller information, and store identifiers.</p><p><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Credit card information (processed securely through PCI-compliant processors), billing address, and subscription details.</p><p><strong>Communication:</strong> Messages sent to support, feedback, feature requests, and bug reports.</p><h3>Information Collected Automatically</h3><p><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, time spent on platform, features used, searches, queries, and performance metrics.</p><p><strong>Device Information:</strong> Browser type and version, operating system, IP address, and device type.</p><p><strong>Cookies and Tracking:</strong> Session cookies, performance analytics, and user preference data.</p><p><strong>Seller Tools / Browser Extension Activity:</strong> When you use the Ecom Circles Seller Tools browser extension, we record which tools you use and when, tied to your Ecom Circles account, along with the associated IP address and browser. We use this to secure your account, support and verify your subscription (including resolving payment disputes), and improve the product. We do not sell this data or share your listings or inventory with third parties.</p><h2>How We Use Information</h2><p>We use your information for service delivery, account management, billing and payments, marketplace integration, customer support, analytics and platform improvement, security and fraud prevention, legal compliance, and communication (updates, notifications, announcements).</p><p>We may contact you about new features and service improvements. You can opt-out of marketing emails at any time.</p><h2>How We Share Information</h2><h3>Information We Do NOT Share</h3><p>We do NOT sell your personal data to third parties, share marketplace credentials with others, or share payment card data.</p><h3>Information We DO Share</h3><p><strong>With Marketplace Platforms:</strong> API tokens (securely) for Amazon, Walmart, and eBay integration.only what is necessary to connect your accounts.</p><p><strong>With Service Providers:</strong> Payment processors (PCI-compliant), email service providers, cloud hosting providers, and analytics providers (anonymized data only).</p><p><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> Law enforcement (with legal warrant/subpoena), regulatory authorities (as required by law), and to protect user safety and platform security.</p><p><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In the event of an acquisition or merger, with confidentiality protections.</p><h2>Data Security</h2><p>We implement SSL/TLS encryption for data in transit, limited employee access to personal data, network firewalls, regular security audits, and hashed and salted password storage.</p><p>No system is 100% secure. We cannot guarantee protection against user negligence, insider threats, or third-party breaches.</p><h2>Your Rights</h2><p><strong>Access and Correction:</strong> You can access your personal information at any time and request corrections to inaccurate data.</p><p><strong>Deletion:</strong> You may request deletion of your account. Some data is retained for legal and accounting purposes. Data is deleted within 90 days of request.</p><p><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time, opt-out of analytics tracking via browser settings, and control cookie preferences.</p><p><strong>Data Portability:</strong> Request your data in a standard format for transfer to another service provider.</p><h2>Cookies</h2><p>We use session cookies (to maintain login), preference cookies (to remember your settings), analytics cookies (to track usage patterns), and security cookies (to prevent fraud). Most browsers allow you to control cookie settings. Disabling cookies may affect platform functionality.</p><h2>Data Retention</h2><p><strong>User Account Data:</strong> Retained while account is active, deleted 90 days after cancellation.</p><p><strong>Transaction Data:</strong> Retained for 7 years (tax and accounting requirements).</p><p><strong>Support Correspondence:</strong> Retained for 2 years.</p><p><strong>Analytics Data:</strong> Retained for 12 months (anonymized).</p><h2>Children’s Privacy</h2><p>Ecom Circles is not intended for users under 16. We do not knowingly collect information from children. If we learn we’ve collected data from a minor, we will delete it immediately.</p><h2>International Users</h2><p>If you are outside the United States, your data may be transferred to and processed in the US. US data protection laws may differ from your country. By using Ecom Circles, you consent to data transfer.</p><h2>GDPR Compliance (EU Users)</h2><p>Users in the European Union have additional rights: right to access and data portability, right to erasure (“right to be forgotten”), right to restrict processing, and right to object to processing. Contact<!-- --> <a href="mailto:privacy@ecomcircles.com" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">privacy@ecomcircles.com</a> <!-- -->to exercise these rights.</p><h2>California Privacy Rights (CCPA/CPRA)</h2><p>California residents have rights to know what personal information is collected, know if data is sold or disclosed, delete personal information, opt-out of data sales, and request correction of inaccurate data. We do not sell personal information. Submit requests via<!-- --> <a href="mailto:privacy@ecomcircles.com" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">privacy@ecomcircles.com</a>.</p><h2>Changes to This Policy</h2><p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Changes become effective when posted. Your continued use constitutes acceptance. We will email significant changes to registered users.</p><h2>Contact Information</h2><p>For privacy concerns or questions:</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@ecomcircles.com" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">privacy@ecomcircles.com</a></p><p><strong>Support Portal:</strong> <a href="https://ecomcircles.crisp.help/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">ecomcircles.crisp.help</a></p><h2>Third-Party Links</h2><p>Ecom Circles may link to third-party websites (Amazon, Walmart, payment processors). We are not responsible for their privacy practices. Review their privacy policies separately.</p><p class="mt-10 text-sm text-neutral-500">See also:<!-- --> <a class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline" href="tos.php">Terms of Service</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline" href="affiliate-disclosure/index.html">Affiliate Disclosure</a></p></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main>
    
